                            <comment id="14570545" author="kuaw26" created="Wed, 3 Jun 2015 09:41:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Anton please proceed with this issue.&lt;br/&gt;
#You need to fix build process to support building 2 version of scala dependent artifacts.&lt;br/&gt;
#Also please fix issue with scaladoc generation for scalar_2.10 and visor_2.10 modules, I commented in poms with TODOs.&lt;br/&gt;
All code committed into ignite-389-3 branch.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14581790" author="avinogradov" created="Thu, 11 Jun 2015 10:26:35 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;decided not to generate scaladoc for 2.10 &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14638425" author="kuaw26" created="Thu, 23 Jul 2015 08:01:03 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;In fact we do not use specific scala 2.10 / scala 2.11 features.&lt;br/&gt;
So issue was fixed by creating &quot;empty&quot; modules with dependencies to scala 2.10 and source path to module with scala code.&lt;br/&gt;
Also special profiles with &quot;-2.10&quot; suffixes were created and build procedure and dev notes were updated accordingly.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14638585" author="avinogradov" created="Thu, 23 Jul 2015 09:54:22 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Reviewed by Alexey Goncharuk&lt;br/&gt;
